# The Commander model is the model running this current session.
# This capability does not set or change the current session model.

# Luna Worker's model, reasoning effort, and developer instructions are
# maintained in ../agents/luna-worker.toml. The preferred native route uses
# the laohu_luna_worker role when the current host has actually loaded it.
# The native generic-Agent route for a host without the role passes model/effort and
# copies instructions into its task message; that is not developer-level role
# configuration. The CLI reads the same model and effort. Verify actual runs
# from host records; a deployed file alone does not prove host availability.

# Do not add a scalar [agents] default_subagent_model table based on an
# upstream example. Codex hosts can use different AgentRoleToml schemas.
